1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,360
I think what we're seeing now, what unfolds in front of our eyes, is a genocidal situation

2
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:15,200
by which people are targeted, whether they are children, babies, in hospital or in schools.

3
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:24,000
And this is a massive operation of killing, of ethnic cleansing, of depopulation. The pretext

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:32,000
for that kind of savagery is revenge for what Hamas did on the 7th of October. But I think the real

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:38,720
intention here is not just revenge, but trying to exploit what happened on the 7th of October

6
00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:46,640
to create new realities in historical Palestine. You called it a new Nakba. I think that this is,

7
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:51,920
the Nakba has never really ended for the Palestinians, so it's a new horrific chapter

8
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:59,600
in the ongoing Nakba that the Palestinians are suffering here. I think the main attempt here

9
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:06,320
is to make sure that people do not understand the context in which the Hamas operation occurred,

10
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:15,440
to totally dis-historicize that event, to forget about the 15 years of inhuman siege on Gaza,

11
00:01:15,440 --> 00:01:22,800
of 56 years of a ruthless occupation and ethnic cleansing in the West Bank and 75 years of not

12
00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:29,440
allowing refugees to come back to their homes. I think this is an attempt to nazify the Palestinians.

13
00:01:29,440 --> 00:01:36,880
The nazification of the Palestinians is meant to, first of all, license Israeli policies without any

14
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:44,720
consideration to international law or human rights, and secondly, to divert us from talking about the

15
00:01:44,720 --> 00:01:52,080
real issue here, which is not the Hamas or its actions on the 7th of October, but rather the

16
00:01:52,080 --> 00:01:58,880
situation that bred this kind of violence. Rather than talking about the symptoms of violence,

17
00:01:58,880 --> 00:02:02,640
we should talk about the source of violence. And the source of violence has not changed.

18
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:08,880
We have millions of Palestinians for years being oppressed, ruled and controlled by Israel,

19
00:02:08,880 --> 00:02:16,880
and they are fighting with the means that they have. And this is going to go on, unless, of course,

20
00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:20,880
there is a willingness to go back to the negotiation table.

